{'symbol': 'HBAN', 'date': '2022-10-06 19:20:00', 'title': 'HUNTINGTON NATIONAL BANK LEADS NATION FOR SBA 7(A) LOAN ORIGINATION BY VOLUME, FOR FIFTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR', 'text': "HUNTINGTON BANK INFUSED NEARLY $1 BILLION INTO THE ECONOMY BY SUPPORTING 5,675 SMALL BUSINESSES IN THE LAST YEAR COLUMBUS, OHIO , OCT. 6, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- HUNTINGTON BANCSHARES INCORPORATED (NASDAQ:\xa0HBAN) IS THE NATION'S LARGEST ORIGINATOR, BY VOLUME, OF SMALL BUSINESS ADMINISTRATION (SBA) 7(A) LOANS FOR THE FIFTH CONSECUTIVE YEAR. AS A NATIONAL LEADER IN THE SMALL BUSINESS SECTOR, HUNTINGTON REMAINS COMMITTED TO LENDING BOTH EXPERTISE AND CAPITAL TO SUSTAIN SMALL BUSINESSES ACROSS THE COUNTRY."}